**On 37 modeled exact-path anchors (39 generated), the sealed C1 head achieved LOAO ordering 0.589 and level R² −0.272; the observed ceiling looks predominantly informational, with an architectural/optimization penalty but only R² 0.093 from the best high-capacity 16-slot fit.**

